Error [jet.MissingReceiverMark]: This call writes `values`, but `values` has no `&` mark
  --> tests/ui/ownership/lending_disjoint_views_reject_every_retaining_boundary_3.jet:5:15
    |
  5 |     selected: values.get_disjoint_write([0, 1]) ?? panic("selection failed")
    |               ^^^^^^
 Why: The method is declared with `&self`, so the call writes the named place it is called on; the mark sits on that place, the same way `edit(&buf)` and `consume(^text)` mark arguments
 Fix: Write `&values`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0224

Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: The lent mutable view `edit` cannot be passed to a call
  --> tests/ui/ownership/lending_disjoint_views_reject_every_retaining_boundary_3.jet:6:36
    |
  6 |     loop edit in selected { retain(edit) }
    |                                    ^^^^
 Why: The view is valid only while the current iteration or callback invocation is active
 Fix: Use the view inside that scope, and keep only owned values outside it
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
